recommenderagent ..> catalogue : uses

' Sources: README.md and docs/architecture.md
note right of recommenderagent
  Interactive audiobook recommendation service.

  Parses requests, resolves conversation context,
  retrieves and ranks books, commits session
  changes, then generates response wording.

  Redis sessions use the (userId, sessionId)
  pair with a 24-hour sliding expiry.

  Catalogue maintenance runs in separate
  opt-in applications.
end note
@enduml
